/or CVD compared with controls", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:09:37.628Z'), source_document:"SECTION 3: TREATMENT", source:"section-3-treatment.md"}}, {start: {_id:79}, end: {_id:45}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"Weight loss (low-energy diet + physical exercises) | Improved erectile function (MD of IIEF=1.99, 95% CI 0.85-3.13)", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:09:37.697Z'), source_document:"SECTION 3: TREATMENT", source:"section-3-treatment.md"}}, {start: {_id:80}, end: {_id:45}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"Bariatric surgery (BMI ≥40 or ≥35 with co-morbidities) | Significantly improved IIEF scores", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:09:37.719Z'), source_document:"SECTION 3: TREATMENT", source:"section-3-treatment.md"}}, {start: {_id:81}, end: {_id:45}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"Pelvic floor muscle training (5-20 therapist-supervised sessions, 3-4 months) | 35-47% cure rate in ED", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:09:37.786Z'), source_document:"SECTION 4: TREATMENT", source:"section-3-treatment.md"}}, {start: {_id:82}, end: {_id:45}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"Smoking cessation | Improved ED irrespective of pack-years and severity", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:09:37.807Z'), source_document:"SECTION 3: TREATMENT", source:"section-3-treatment.md"}}, {start: {_id:83}, end: {_id:45}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"Alcohol abstinence (3 months) | Improved IIEF-5 scores (p<0.001)", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:09:37.828Z'), source_document:"SECTION 3: TREATMENT", source:"section-3-treatment.md"}}, {start: {_id:90}, end: {_id:91}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"Mechanical devices (e.g. vacuum erection device or shockwave therapy) may be offered in erectile dysfunction (ED).", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:09:54.706Z'), source_document:"SECTION 4.3: Mechanical Treatment", source:"section-4-3-mechanical.md"}}, {start: {_id:93}, end: {_id:91}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"Mechanical devices (e.g. vacuum erection device or shockwave therapy) may be offered in erectile dysfunction (ED).", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:09:54.802Z'), source_document:"SECTION 4.3: Mechanical Treatment", source:"section-4-3-mechanical.md"}}, {start: {_id:100}, end: {_id:162}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"Penile Prosthesis: Satisfaction rate up to 79%", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:11:19.582Z'), source_document:"SECTION 8: SPECIAL POPULATIONS", source:"section-8-special-populations.md"}}, {start: {_id:100}, end: {_id:327}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"Used when other types of treatment modalities have failed", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:26:32.689Z'), source_document:"SECTION 4.3: Mechanical Treatment", source:"section-4-3-mechanical.md"}}, {start: {_id:102}, end: {_id:103}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"In managing stress, counselling is helpful as an initial step to provide support and guidance regarding ED.", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:10:15.248Z'), source_document:"SECTION 3: TREATMENT", source:"section-4-treatment.md"}}, {start: {_id:104}, end: {_id:45}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"Psychotherapy, on the other hand, goes one step further and is directed towards gaining insights into chronic and recurrent emotional and cognitive patterns, and their contribution to ED", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:10:15.288Z'), source_document:"SECTION 3: TREATMENT", source:"section-4-treatment.md"}}, {start: {_id:137}, end: {_id:91}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"If initial treatments (e.g. lifestyle changes, oral medications like PDE5i, or other conservative measures) do not yield satisfactory results,", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:11:00.54Z'), source_document:"SECTION 7: REFERRAL", source:"section-7-referral.md"}}, {start: {_id:138}, end: {_id:91}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"If initial treatments do not yield satisfactory results, or if a case is complex and may require specialised interventions: Penile injections", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:11:00.682Z'), source_document:"SECTION 7: REFERRAL", source:"section-7-referral.md"}}, {start: {_id:140}, end: {_id:91}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"If initial treatments do not yield satisfactory results, or if a case is complex and may require specialised interventions: Surgical options", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:11:00.791Z'), source_document:"SECTION 7: REFERRAL", source:"section-7-referral.md"}}, {start: {_id:158}, end: {_id:159}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"Combination of VED + Tadalafil 20 mg showed significantly higher IIEF scores at 6-12 months compared to Tadalafil alone", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:11:19.379Z'), source_document:"SECTION 8: SPECIAL POPULATIONS", source:"section-8-special-populations.md"}}, {start: {_id:164}, end: {_id:162}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"VED: Successful vaginal penetration: 70-93%", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:11:19.515Z'), source_document:"SECTION 8: SPECIAL POPULATIONS", source:"section-8-special-populations.md"}}, {start: {_id:165}, end: {_id:162}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"Sacral Neuromodulation: <50% effectiveness", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:11:19.648Z'), source_document:"SECTION 8: SPECIAL POPULATIONS", source:"section-8-special-populations.md"}}, {start: {_id:325}, end: {_id:91}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"VED + Sildenafil 100 mg vs sildenafil alone showed: Significantly higher IIEF scores at one month and three months", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:26:32.599Z'), source_document:"SECTION 4.3: Mechanical Treatment", source:"section-4-3-mechanical.md"}}, {start: {_id:378}, end: {_id:379}, properties:{chunk_index:0, evidence:"Combination of VED + Tadalafil 20 mg showed significantly higher IIEF scores at 6-12 months compared to Tadalafil alone", created_at:datetime('2026-04-30T12:28:57.075Z'), source_document:"SECTION 8: SPECIAL POPULATIONS", source:"section-8-special-populations.md"}